re-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925775","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078840-1844751498226409","game_id":"steam-5078840","kind":"update","title":"Second Major Demo Update: Weapons, New Events, and a Complete Visual Refresh","summary":"Hello everyone! Another major update for the Grimoire of Hecate: Tower of Starlight demo is now available. This time, we’ve added a weapon system, new campfire events, and discoveries that unlock more of the Wanderers’ Garden. We’ve also finished refreshing the demo’s pixel art. Choose a Weapon for Your Next Run https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46269216/2e90403a8266413c73b49e377d722cb69917cc12.gif The Garden now has a Weapon Storehouse. Find its hidden path while exploring the Tower to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T03:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226409","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078840-1844115010493959","game_id":"steam-5078840","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: More Rewards, Renewed Pixel Art and New Encounters","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46269216/92af3b882b81cf05a71a0a99257775a278f05200.png A major update to the Grimoire of Hecate: Tower of Starlight demo is here! Since the demo's August release, we've been working to make each journey through the Tower more rewarding. This update brings more generous card and Memory Shard rewards, renewed pixel art, improved combat and new ways to explore and experiment. More rewards and smoother progression Card rewards and Memory Shards earned through runs have been increas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T06:52:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493959","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078840-1841579228670541","game_id":"steam-5078840","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Livestream : Demo Gameplay","summary":"Broadcast Schedule - Friday, Aug. 22 (AEST / UTC+10)Session 1: 6:00 PM - 7:00 PM AESTSession 2: 10:00 PM - 11:00 AM AESTJoin me for a live developer playthrough of the demo for Grimoire of Hecate: Tower of Starlight, a card combination roguelite where discovered spells can be combined into powerful magic.During the broadcast, I’ll explore the tower, build spell combinations, face challenging encounters, and demonstrate the game’s crafting and progression systems. I’ll also be watching the chat, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T01:36:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670541","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078840-1841579228667208","game_id":"steam-5078840","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Livestream: Demo Gameplay","summary":"Broadcast Schedule - Friday, Aug. 21 (AEST / UTC+10)Session 1: 1:00 PM - 3:00 PM AESTSession 2: 10:00 PM - 12:00 AM AESTJoin me for a live developer playthrough of the demo for Grimoire of Hecate: Tower of Starlight, a card combination roguelite where discovered spells can be combined into powerful magic.During the broadcast, I’ll explore the tower, build spell combinations, face challenging encounters, and demonstrate the game’s crafting and progression systems. I’ll also be watching the chat, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T00:30:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667208","verified_at":"2